Chapter: SerialBusGrantLeak

  cites Foreword chapter SerialLine

 A handler that receives the linear RS485 bus grant but never releases
 or forwards it leaves the bus driven -- a resource leak. The linear
 type discipline rejects it at compile time (CDX2063, linear value
 never used).

  handle-and-drop : linear Integer -> Integer
  handle-and-drop (grant) = 0

  opening : Integer = handle-and-drop (serial-bus-acquire 7)
